{"total": 57.409, "lines": [{"cap": "This throw was so far… they had to change the javelin.", "start": 0.36, "end": 3.016, "audio_at": 0.3, "dur": 2.896292, "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.504}, {"text": "throw", "start": 0.516, "end": 0.757}, {"text": "was", "start": 0.769, "end": 0.925}, {"text": "so", "start": 0.937, "end": 1.165}, {"text": "far", "start": 1.177, "end": 1.598}, {"text": "they", "start": 1.886, "end": 1.971}, {"text": "had", "start": 1.983, "end": 2.103}, {"text": "to", "start": 2.115, "end": 2.163}, {"text": "change", "start": 2.175, "end": 2.499}, {"text": "the", "start": 2.511, "end": 2.572}, {"text": "javelin", "start": 2.584, "end": 3.016}]}, {"cap": "July 1984, East Berlin. A twenty-two-year-old named Uwe Hohn picks up a javelin.", "start": 3.586, "end": 9.055, "audio_at": 3.526, "dur": 5.70875, "words": [{"text": "July 1984", "start": 3.586, "end": 4.848}, {"text": "East", "start": 5.125, "end": 5.305}, {"text": "Berlin", "start": 5.317, "end": 5.714}, {"text": "A", "start": 6.11, "end": 6.158}, {"text": "twenty-two-year-old", "start": 6.17, "end": 7.06}, {"text": "named", "start": 7.18, "end": 7.42}, {"text": "Uwe", "start": 7.565, "end": 7.817}, {"text": "Hohn", "start": 7.829, "end": 8.118}, {"text": "picks", "start": 8.13, "end": 8.43}, {"text": "up", "start": 8.442, "end": 8.526}, {"text": "a", "start": 8.538, "end": 8.586}, {"text": "javelin", "start": 8.598, "end": 9.055}]}, {"cap": "Nobody had ever thrown one hundred meters. That's longer than a soccer field.", "start": 9.525, "end": 13.359, "audio_at": 9.465, "dur": 4.074125, "words": [{"text": "Nobody", "start": 9.525, "end": 9.862}, {"text": "had", "start": 9.874, "end": 10.018}, {"text": "ever", "start": 10.03, "end": 10.246}, {"text": "thrown", "start": 10.258, "end": 10.619}, {"text": "one", "start": 10.631, "end": 10.751}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 10.763, "end": 11.039}, {"text": "meters", "start": 11.051, "end": 11.532}, {"text": "That's", "start": 11.941, "end": 12.097}, {"text": "longer", "start": 12.109, "end": 12.434}, {"text": "than", "start": 12.446, "end": 12.554}, {"text": "a", "start": 12.566, "end": 12.602}, {"text": "soccer", "start": 12.614, "end": 12.987}, {"text": "field", "start": 12.999, "end": 13.359}]}, {"cap": "He runs. He throws.", "start": 13.829, "end": 15.308, "audio_at": 13.769, "dur": 1.718334, "words": [{"text": "He", "start": 13.829, "end": 13.889}, {"text": "runs", "start": 13.901, "end": 14.334}, {"text": "He", "start": 14.743, "end": 14.815}, {"text": "throws", "start": 14.827, "end": 15.308}]}, {"cap": "And it just… keeps… going.", "start": 15.728, "end": 17.014, "audio_at": 15.668, "dur": 1.526084, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 15.728, "end": 15.8}, {"text": "it", "start": 15.812, "end": 15.884}, {"text": "just", "start": 15.896, "end": 16.196}, {"text": "keeps", "start": 16.401, "end": 16.689}, {"text": "going", "start": 16.713, "end": 17.014}]}, {"cap": "One hundred and four point eight meters.", "start": 17.534, "end": 19.048, "audio_at": 17.474, "dur": 1.754458, "words": [{"text": "One", "start": 17.534, "end": 17.618}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 17.63, "end": 17.882}, {"text": "and", "start": 17.894, "end": 17.966}, {"text": "four", "start": 17.978, "end": 18.207}, {"text": "point", "start": 18.219, "end": 18.471}, {"text": "eight", "start": 18.483, "end": 18.603}, {"text": "meters", "start": 18.615, "end": 19.048}]}, {"cap": "The crowd went silent. It almost flew right onto the running track.", "start": 19.668, "end": 23.118, "audio_at": 19.608, "dur": 3.689542, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 19.668, "end": 19.716}, {"text": "crowd", "start": 19.728, "end": 20.077}, {"text": "went", "start": 20.089, "end": 20.233}, {"text": "silent", "start": 20.245, "end": 20.726}, {"text": "It", "start": 21.134, "end": 21.207}, {"text": "almost", "start": 21.219, "end": 21.519}, {"text": "flew", "start": 21.531, "end": 21.88}, {"text": "right", "start": 21.892, "end": 22.132}, {"text": "onto", "start": 22.144, "end": 22.324}, {"text": "the", "start": 22.336, "end": 22.42}, {"text": "running", "start": 22.432, "end": 22.649}, {"text": "track", "start": 22.661, "end": 23.118}]}, {"cap": "And old javelins often landed flat, so judges couldn't even tell where they hit.", "start": 23.588, "end": 28.047, "audio_at": 23.528, "dur": 4.699084, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 23.588, "end": 23.744}, {"text": "old", "start": 23.756, "end": 23.996}, {"text": "javelins", "start": 24.008, "end": 24.561}, {"text": "often", "start": 24.621, "end": 24.946}, {"text": "landed", "start": 24.958, "end": 25.258}, {"text": "flat", "start": 25.27, "end": 25.631}, {"text": "so", "start": 25.991, "end": 26.184}, {"text": "judges", "start": 26.196, "end": 26.628}, {"text": "couldn't", "start": 26.64, "end": 26.953}, {"text": "even", "start": 26.965, "end": 27.193}, {"text": "tell", "start": 27.205, "end": 27.446}, {"text": "where", "start": 27.458, "end": 27.578}, {"text": "they", "start": 27.59, "end": 27.71}, {"text": "hit", "start": 27.722, "end": 28.047}]}, {"cap": "But here's the crazy part.", "start": 28.567, "end": 29.66, "audio_at": 28.507, "dur": 1.33375, "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 28.567, "end": 28.639}, {"text": "here's", "start": 28.651, "end": 28.867}, {"text": "the", "start": 28.879, "end": 28.963}, {"text": "crazy", "start": 28.975, "end": 29.3}, {"text": "part", "start": 29.312, "end": 29.66}]}, {"cap": "Instead of building bigger stadiums, they changed the javelin itself.", "start": 30.13, "end": 33.556, "audio_at": 30.07, "dur": 3.6655, "words": [{"text": "Instead", "start": 30.13, "end": 30.431}, {"text": "of", "start": 30.443, "end": 30.551}, {"text": "building", "start": 30.563, "end": 30.864}, {"text": "bigger", "start": 30.876, "end": 31.164}, {"text": "stadiums", "start": 31.176, "end": 31.789}, {"text": "they", "start": 31.993, "end": 32.138}, {"text": "changed", "start": 32.15, "end": 32.534}, {"text": "the", "start": 32.546, "end": 32.618}, {"text": "javelin", "start": 32.63, "end": 33.003}, {"text": "itself", "start": 33.015, "end": 33.556}]}, {"cap": "In 1986, they moved its center of gravity four centimeters forward.", "start": 34.026, "end": 38.461, "audio_at": 33.966, "dur": 4.675084, "words": [{"text": "In 1986", "start": 34.026, "end": 35.192}, {"text": "they", "start": 35.408, "end": 35.528}, {"text": "moved", "start": 35.54, "end": 35.829}, {"text": "its", "start": 35.841, "end": 35.961}, {"text": "center", "start": 35.973, "end": 36.358}, {"text": "of", "start": 36.37, "end": 36.454}, {"text": "gravity", "start": 36.466, "end": 36.983}, {"text": "four", "start": 37.079, "end": 37.451}, {"text": "centimeters", "start": 37.463, "end": 37.992}, {"text": "forward", "start": 38.004, "end": 38.461}]}, {"cap": "Now the tip drops sooner and stabs into the ground. It flies about ten percent shorter.", "start": 38.931, "end": 43.582, "audio_at": 38.871, "dur": 4.891417, "words": [{"text": "Now", "start": 38.931, "end": 39.039}, {"text": "the", "start": 39.051, "end": 39.159}, {"text": "tip", "start": 39.171, "end": 39.4}, {"text": "drops", "start": 39.412, "end": 39.76}, {"text": "sooner", "start": 39.772, "end": 40.181}, {"text": "and", "start": 40.409, "end": 40.469}, {"text": "stabs", "start": 40.481, "end": 40.878}, {"text": "into", "start": 40.89, "end": 41.022}, {"text": "the", "start": 41.034, "end": 41.094}, {"text": "ground", "start": 41.106, "end": 41.539}, {"text": "It", "start": 41.936, "end": 42.02}, {"text": "flies", "start": 42.032, "end": 42.369}, {"text": "about", "start": 42.381, "end": 42.633}, {"text": "ten", "start": 42.645, "end": 42.825}, {"text": "percent", "start": 42.837, "end": 43.174}, {"text": "shorter", "start": 43.186, "end": 43.582}]}, {"cap": "So Uwe Hohn's record was frozen. Forever.", "start": 44.152, "end": 46.676, "audio_at": 44.092, "dur": 2.764041, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 44.152, "end": 44.369}, {"text": "Uwe", "start": 44.381, "end": 44.609}, {"text": "Hohn's", "start": 44.621, "end": 44.91}, {"text": "record", "start": 44.922, "end": 45.258}, {"text": "was", "start": 45.27, "end": 45.414}, {"text": "frozen", "start": 45.426, "end": 45.847}, {"text": "Forever", "start": 46.268, "end": 46.676}]}, {"cap": "Today's world record with the new javelin? Ninety-eight point four eight.", "start": 47.246, "end": 50.768, "audio_at": 47.186, "dur": 3.761667, "words": [{"text": "Today's", "start": 47.246, "end": 47.571}, {"text": "world", "start": 47.583, "end": 47.932}, {"text": "record", "start": 47.944, "end": 48.28}, {"text": "with", "start": 48.292, "end": 48.4}, {"text": "the", "start": 48.412, "end": 48.484}, {"text": "new", "start": 48.496, "end": 48.713}, {"text": "javelin", "start": 48.725, "end": 49.17}, {"text": "Ninety-eight", "start": 49.566, "end": 50.011}, {"text": "point", "start": 50.023, "end": 50.275}, {"text": "four", "start": 50.287, "end": 50.528}, {"text": "eight", "start": 50.54, "end": 50.768}]}, {"cap": "Forty years later, nobody has even reached one hundred again.", "start": 51.288, "end": 54.557, "audio_at": 51.228, "dur": 3.5092490000000005, "words": [{"text": "Forty", "start": 51.288, "end": 51.492}, {"text": "years", "start": 51.504, "end": 51.745}, {"text": "later", "start": 51.757, "end": 52.069}, {"text": "nobody", "start": 52.442, "end": 52.779}, {"text": "has", "start": 52.791, "end": 52.959}, {"text": "even", "start": 53.091, "end": 53.404}, {"text": "reached", "start": 53.416, "end": 53.752}, {"text": "one", "start": 53.764, "end": 53.896}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 53.908, "end": 54.209}, {"text": "again", "start": 54.221, "end": 54.557}]}, {"cap": "All because one man threw it so far…", "start": 55.127, "end": 57.099, "audio_at": 55.067, "dur": 2.211125, "words": [{"text": "All", "start": 55.127, "end": 55.248}, {"text": "because", "start": 55.26, "end": 55.548}, {"text": "one", "start": 55.56, "end": 55.824}, {"text": "man", "start": 55.837, "end": 56.101}, {"text": "threw", "start": 56.113, "end": 56.317}, {"text": "it", "start": 56.329, "end": 56.413}, {"text": "so", "start": 56.425, "end": 56.642}, {"text": "far", "start": 56.654, "end": 57.099}]}]}